.el .ds Aq '
.TH elfshaker-esi-remove 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-esi\-remove \- Removes pack URLs from one or more ESI indexes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker esi remove\fR [OPTIONS] <ESI_FILE> <PACK_URL>...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes pack URLs from one or more ESI indexes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Ignore stored URLs that are not present.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-backup\fR
Do not replace <ESI_FILE>.bak with the previous contents.
.TP
\fB\-\-also\fR \fI<ESI_FILE>\fR
Apply the operation to another ESI file; may be repeated.
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show informational progress and diagnostic messages.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIESI_FILE\fR>
Primary ESI file to edit.
.TP
<\fIPACK_URL\fR>...
Stored pack URLs to remove.
